# synthetic -- NOT a capture. The TP=2 cluster head (http://192.0.2.2:8100) refused on
# 2026-09-15 at 21:17Z. Built from the exposed family names, types and labels cited in
# worklog/vllm-gateway-throughput.md Q2 (vLLM v0.29.0 vllm/v1/metrics/loggers.py and
# vllm/v1/spec_decode/metrics.py), for the head of a group running
# `--speculative-config {"method":"mtp","num_speculative_tokens":4}`. The image adds six local
# patches (qsa-fused-draft touches drafting), so the spec-decode shape holds for upstream only.
# Shape: serving, 3.32 tokens accepted per draft step (1 + 27840 / 12000) and 58 % of drafted
# tokens accepted (27840 / 48000). Follow-up for the coordinator: replace with a live GET of the
